WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:05.755
[announcer] The Great Champion.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:07.841
Apollo!

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:10.010
[cheering]

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:15.473
The Warrior!

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.851
Ares!

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:20.353
[crowd cheering]

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.692
[announcer] Do not blink, lest you miss…

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:27.861
Hermes!

00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:30.905
[flapping]

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:34.576
[both grunt]

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:42.417
Yah!

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.509
[all gasp]

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.056
[grunts]

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:05.940
[zaps]

00:01:12.155 --> 00:01:13.198
[thunder rumbles]

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:18.244
[Zeus] What did you tell your mother?

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:23.208
You're the only one who knew where I was.

00:01:24.709 --> 00:01:26.461
What did you say?

00:01:26.544 --> 00:01:28.254
[crows cawing]

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:33.093
Nothing I didn't already know.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:36.721
[majestic music playing]

